
~ start

if GameState.safe_opened
	PLUM: The safe is empty now... (sad)
	PLUM: What if we just robbed an old woman? (worried)
	VINCENT: We'll buy her another chair.
	=> END

else
	PLUM: It's a safe! (suprised)
	VINCENT: Yes. We all have eyes.
	PLUM: What if there's an evil genuis who keeps kids in it. (scared)
	VINCENT: Nope. (serious)
	PLUM: And you know that because? (serious)
	VINCENT: It's my job Plum. I know things. (angry)
	VINCENT: And you're 10. You don't know things. (smug)

	- Enter '274' [if GameState.can_open_safe()]
		PLUM: We finally get to see what's in it. (happy)
		PLUM: What? A stool? (serious)
		$> GameState.open_safe()
		Stool was added to your items.
		=> END

	- Enter a random code
		PLUM: What if the code is '111'? (silly)
		VINCENT: Very original. (smug)
		PLUM: It's not just 1's... it's like 5 in binary. (worried)
		You enter the code '111'.
		For a moment nothing happens.
		And then... [screen=P_Dead] [scene=game_over]
		=> END

	- Do Nothing
		VINCENT: Were you about to enter something. (angry)
		PLUM: Noo... (smug)
		=> END
